sequenceDiagram
    actor Artist
    participant Client as Next.js client
    participant Cognito as Cognito Hosted UI
    participant Google as Google OAuth
    participant API as FastAPI backend

    Artist->>Client: Select Continue with Google
    Client->>Cognito: Start OAuth code flow (PKCE)
    Cognito->>Google: Redirect to Google authorization
    Artist->>Google: Sign in and grant consent
    Google-->>Cognito: Authorization response
    Cognito-->>Client: Redirect /sso-callback with code
    Client->>Cognito: Amplify exchanges code
    Cognito-->>Client: Cognito ID token
    Client->>API: POST /auth/session\nAuthorization: Bearer ID token
    API->>Cognito: Validate signed JWT
    Cognito-->>API: Verified claims
    API-->>Client: Set-Cookie: HttpOnly application session
    Client->>API: Protected API/SSE request\nCookie: application session
    API-->>Client: Protected response or stream
